 "Поэтому площадь одного треугольника": "<figure class='st'><svg viewBox='-2 -2 96 36' role='img' aria-label='Общая высота: пример'><polygon points='4,10 4,28 40,28' fill='#f0a83c' fill-opacity='0.3' stroke='#f0a83c' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><polygon points='4,10 4,28 16,28' fill='#5ba8f5' fill-opacity='0.55' stroke='#5ba8f5' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><line x1='4' y1='10' x2='4' y2='28' stroke='#e8eef6' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-dasharray='1.6 1.2'/><text x='10' y='33' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='3.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>2</text><text x='28' y='33' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>6</text><text x='0.3999999999999999' y='20.2' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='3.4' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>3</text><text x='68' y='12' fill='#5ba8f5' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>2 · 3 : 2 = 3</text><text x='68' y='19' fill='#f0a83c' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>6 · 3 : 2 = 9</text><text x='68' y='26' fill='#e8eef6' font-size='3.6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>6 = 3 · 2,  9 = 3 · 3</text></svg><figcaption>Пример на числах, не из задачи.</figcaption></figure>",
